          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"feather_new\">FEATHER_new</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">For each graph node and accessibility category, the notebook computes the\n<strong>shortest walking-network distance to the nearest POI</strong>. These distances are\npassed to FEATHER_new directly in <strong>metres</strong>. No 20 km scaling or other\nnormalization is applied.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Therefore the characteristic-function phase is <code>theta * distance_m</code>.\nThis can oscillate very rapidly for large distances; that behaviour is\nintentional in this raw-metres experiment.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
