      "id": "TRpd",
      "code_hash": "323bc8d6bff99f43297d0040523b95c5",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"cache-layout\">Cache layout</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\"><code>../cache/&lt;city&gt;/</code> keeps the city boundary, clipped city PBF, graph pickle, POI GeoJSON, and source metadata. These are the expensive reusable inputs.</span>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">The much larger regional Geofabrik file is temporary. It is downloaded once for all cities that use the same source, clipped into city PBFs, and deleted only after every clip from that source succeeds.</span>\n<ul>\n<li>Set <code>FORCE_REFRESH_CITY_PBF = True</code> to fetch a fresh OSM snapshot.</li>\n<li>Set <code>FORCE_REBUILD_DERIVED = True</code> to rebuild graph and POI caches from the existing city PBF.</li>\n</ul></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
